  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"float:right;max-width: 35%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><b>Cost</b></td>\n<td>$320,000, 10,000x <a href=\"/index.php/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">steel</a>, <br />100,000x <a href=\"/index.php/Aluminum\" title=\"Aluminum\">aluminum</a>, 20,000x <a href=\"/index.php/Glass\" title=\"Glass\">glass</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Total Cost</b></td>\n<td>$1,400,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Inputs</b></td>\n<td>1x <a href=\"/index.php/CCD\" title=\"CCD\">CCD</a>, 100x <a href=\"/index.php/Plastic\" title=\"Plastic\">plastic</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Outputs</b></td>\n<td>1x <a href=\"/index.php/Digital_camera\" title=\"Digital camera\">digital camera</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production interval</b></td>\n<td>1 minute and 20 seconds\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production/Hour</b></td>\n<td>45x <a href=\"/index.php/Digital_camera\" title=\"Digital camera\">digital camera</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/sec</b></td>\n<td>$25.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Min</b></td>\n<td>$1,500.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Hour</b></td>\n<td>$90,000.00\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Return On Investment</b></td>\n<td>0.078%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Time to ROI</b></td>\n<td>1,287.36 Minute<br />(~21 Hours)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>aliases</b></td>\n<td>digital camera factory, <br />digitalcamerafactory, <br />digital camera fac, <br />camera factory, camera fac\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Sustaining it requires use of 13/16 <a href=\"/index.php/CCD_factory\" title=\"CCD factory\">CCD factory</a> and 5/32 <a href=\"/index.php/Plastic_factory\" title=\"Plastic factory\">Plastic factory</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009145604\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 by